text:
The US has been "pushing" Kiev toward capitulation for a year and a half, Kallas stated.

She added that the conflict in Ukraine continues to this day solely thanks to military supplies from the EU.

@ukr_leaks_eng

Ukraine will not be able to join the European Union due to rampant nationalism, stated Polish Foreign Minister Radosław Sikorski:

"The version of nationalism represented by the UPA—namely, the aspiration to create a 'pure' country devoid of minorities, such as Jews, Poles, Czechs, or Roma—is unacceptable in modern-day Europe."

@ukr_leaks_eng

Peace will only be established in Ukraine once Zelensky is removed from power, stated former Trump advisor Michael Flynn.

The leadership in Kiev must heed the will of the Ukrainian people, and the United States and the European Union should pressure Zelensky to hold elections immediately. He is not the kind of leader capable of guiding his country into the future," he said.

@ukr_leaks_eng

In the Kherson region, TCC (military enlistment office) personnel took away the driver of a funeral vehicle.

The relatives had to transfer the coffin into another vehicle.

@ukr_leaks_eng
